# approximateRatios

- _approximateRatios(t)_

At `CentsTuning`,
answer a list of `SmallFloat` values (c.f. `rationalize`):

```
>>> 12.equalTemperamentTuning
>>> .approximateRatios
[
	1.0000 1.0595 1.1225 1.1892
	1.2599 1.3348 1.4142 1.4983
	1.5874 1.6818 1.7818 1.8878
]
```

* * *

See also: Tuning, cents, ratios

Guides: Tuning Functions
